  await advance;
  clear dialogue;
  wait breath 220ms;
  narrate "「...別に、これがおしゃれだから...余計なお世話」";
  await advance;
  clear dialogue;
  wait breath 220ms;
  narrate "ミオはそう言って、スカートの裾を掴む。";
  await advance;
  clear dialogue;
